OL,3,GNEWSANational Geographic hails
OL,4,A'thrilling and overlooked' part of
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "thrilling and overlooked" part of
OL,8,FScotland has received recognition as
OL,9,Fone of the best travel destinations on
OL,10,Fthe planet
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway is the only UK
OL,13,Fsite on the National Geographic's Best
OL,14,Fof the World list for 2027.
OL,16,FIt praises the area's attractions
OL,17,Fincluding its role as a dark sky
OL,18,Fdestination for stargazers, as well as
OL,19,Fits cycling and walking routes.
